{"id":"vod_zy360_73675","vodId":"73675","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"忍者神威","name_cn":"忍者神威","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本,美国","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20250504-1/abae1b793d5c00809f85a394aeb9012d.jpg"},"summary":"AdultSwim宣布制作科幻动作冒险题材原创动画剧集《NinjaKamui》，朴性厚（《咒术回战》导演）执导，岡崎能士（《星球大战：幻境》）负责角色设计，E&amp;HProduction和SolaEntertainment共同制作。故事讲述忍者Kamui为了逃避自己的血腥过往，脱离忍者组织，隐姓埋名地生活着。然而由于他背叛了忍者古老的信条，一天夜晚，他的家人被前组织的暗杀者残忍杀害。为了给亲人复仇，Kamui重新化身为从前的自己。然而，二十一世纪的忍者是一个时代错误，因为他们要以残酷而古老的技巧对抗高科技武器。Kamui要面对训练有素的刺客、战斗机器人以及其它强大的忍者，来推翻他的前组织。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动作,科幻,动画,惊悚,犯罪,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-05-04 21:40:12","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/iE0ncW1J/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/PtVkIVK8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/u2DOakH8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/rK3Umulj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/6vplSNeZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/IFMIvMt3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/VlgIIE6c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/Osc94ZhF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/By5ANWRR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/MXf1CGqM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/XUUy0Mpa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250504/BTUQEtiS/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:19.683Z"}